@model MyVoltage.Models.OperationalModels.AF_AfroxAdministration.AF_AfroxAdministrationModels.AF_AfroxAdministration_SnapshotEmailsModel
@inject MyVoltage.Services.OperationalProvider opProv;
@using MyVoltage.Extensions;
@{
    ViewData["Title"] = MyVoltage.Data.SecureAreaEnum.AF_AfroxAdministration_SnapshotEmails.GetDescription();
}
<div id="loaderContent" class="loader-overlay-content">
    <div class="loader">
        <div class="text-orange text-center">
            <i class="fas fa-spinner fa-spin fa-2x"></i>&nbsp;Loading...
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
<table class="table table-sm table-striped table-hover table-bordered">
    <thead>
        <tr>
            <th scope="col">Email</th>
            <th scope="col"></th>
        </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
        <tr>
            <td scope="col">
                <input type="text" id="email_" class="form-control" />
            </td>
            <td scope="col" class="text-nowrap">
                <a href="#" onclick="DoAddStatus();" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-primary-sm" title="Add"><i class="fas fa-plus-circle"></i>&nbsp;Add</a>
            </td>
        </tr>
        @foreach (var item in Model.AF_AfroxAdministration_SnapshotEmailsItems)
        {
            <tr>
                <td scope="col">
                    <input type="text" id="email_@item.ID" class="form-control" value="@item.Email" />
                </td>
                <td scope="col" class="text-nowrap">
                    <a href="#" onclick="DoUpdateStatus('@item.ID');" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-primary-sm" title="Update"><i class="fas fa-edit"></i>&nbsp;Update</a>
                    &nbsp;
                    <a href="#" onclick="DoDeleteStatus('@item.ID');" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-primary-sm" title="Delete"><i class="fas fa-trash-alt"></i>&nbsp;Delete</a>
                </td>
            </tr>
        }
    </tbody>
</table>


@section Scripts {
    <script>
        function DoAddStatus() {
            $("#loaderContent").css("display", "block");

            $.post("/operational/AF_AfroxAdministration/AF_AfroxAdministration_SnapshotEmails_Add",
                {
                    email: $("#email_").val()
                })
                .done(function (data) {
                    $("#loaderContent").css("display", "none");
                    if (data == "true") {
                        alert("Success");
                        $("#loaderContent").css("display", "block");
                        window.location.reload();
                    }
                    else {
                        alert("There was a problem completing requested action.");
                    }
                });
        }

        function DoUpdateStatus(ItemID) {
            $("#loaderContent").css("display", "block");

            $.post("/operational/AF_AfroxAdministration/AF_AfroxAdministration_SnapshotEmails_Update/" + ItemID,
                {
                    email: $("#email_" + ItemID).val()
                })
                .done(function (data) {
                    $("#loaderContent").css("display", "none");
                    if (data == "true") {
                        alert("Success");
                        $("#loaderContent").css("display", "block");
                        window.location.reload();
                    }
                    else {
                        alert("There was a problem completing requested action.");
                    }
                });
        }

        function DoDeleteStatus(ItemID) {
            $("#loaderContent").css("display", "block");

            $.post("/operational/AF_AfroxAdministration/AF_AfroxAdministration_SnapshotEmails_Delete/" + ItemID,
                {
                })
                .done(function (data) {
                    $("#loaderContent").css("display", "none");
                    if (data == "true") {
                        alert("Success");
                        $("#loaderContent").css("display", "block");
                        window.location.reload();
                    }
                    else {
                        alert("There was a problem completing requested action.");
                    }
                });
        }


    </script>
}
